      "document_sha256": "be1817ce96cd101e2ecf98b1bdcb6cdd257b98251deb502633d002e00913e46a",
      "start": 601,
      "end": 894,
      "quote": "for the 1502 edition we used the digitised print from the Bavarian State Library in Munich, which is an exceptional repository of early printed books. Seventy per cent of what we look for among incunabula, late-fifteenth-century printed books and sixteenth-century editions can be found there.",
