      "start": 99,
      "end": 400,
      "quote": "Sometimes there are errors that need to be corrected in the Latin text, or things that are not understood. Sometimes there are gaps because something was lost during printing, in the passage from manuscript to print, and so the text has to be critically restored with the help of two printed editions.",
